{
  "name": "Teste A/B WhatsApp - Contagem de membros dos grupos (WAHA)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c5459432-b6ef-4149-b4f2-f769903e7553",
      "name": "A cada 10 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2869d8fd-d902-4469-860e-6745bc468ef6",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "72f1e5ae-3ce5-47ea-941e-1da518fe0be8",
              "name": "site_url",
              "value": "https://SEU-SITE.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "09c22d40-cc8e-4b79-be68-cb947392adb7",
              "name": "waha_url",
              "value": "https://SEU-WAHA.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "7b1609c4-b3d0-40eb-b77a-69edf872d34c",
              "name": "waha_session",
              "value": "default",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "112adbdb-cbf2-4ccc-a13d-751b96871a9c",
      "name": "Plugin: listar grupos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.site_url.replace(/\\/$/, '') }}/wp-json/iwab/v1/groups",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d8085141-004b-4653-b943-029b67da64bf",
      "name": "Separar grupos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "groups",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "025d8828-7677-4bc0-958f-a8758753484e",
      "name": "Já tem o id do grupo?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d1035c9f-1334-4e6c-be81-2425c67292d4",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.jid }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c52bae5b-4bf4-4727-ae45-37706fd58703",
      "name": "WAHA: achar grupo pelo convite",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.waha_url }}/api/{{ $('Configuração').first().json.waha_session }}/groups/join-info",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "specifyQuery": "keypair",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "code",
              "value": "={{ $json.invite_code }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "21afbf99-c409-414c-896d-185ba99d2406",
      "name": "Grupo + id",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Junta o grupo do plugin com o id dele no WhatsApp (jid). Quem já tinha jid passa direto;\n// quem não tinha pega do join-info do WAHA (o formato muda conforme o motor do WAHA).\nconst group = $('Separar grupos').item.json;\nlet jid = group.jid || '';\nif (!jid) {\n  const raw = $json.id || $json.JID || $json.jid || '';\n  jid = typeof raw === 'object' ? (raw._serialized || '') : String(raw);\n}\nreturn { json: { id: group.id, group: group.group, test: group.test, jid } };"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dea982fb-0264-4eae-8698-7278ab99edc7",
      "name": "WAHA: membros do grupo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        1540,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.waha_url }}/api/{{ $('Configuração').first().json.waha_session }}/groups/{{ encodeURIComponent($json.jid) }}/participants",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8f95c236-7e80-46ad-a85d-95d0d953c556",
      "name": "Contar membros",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Só a contagem sai daqui: a lista de participantes (telefones) não é guardada nem enviada.\nconst g = $('Grupo + id').item.json;\nconst ok = $json.statusCode === 200 && Array.isArray($json.body);\nreturn { json: { id: g.id, group: g.group, test: g.test, jid: g.jid, ok, members: ok ? $json.body.length : null, status: $json.statusCode || null } };"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "21050349-b727-4685-a5d7-b60adacd045f",
      "name": "Contou?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "0f7e153a-a1f5-4b40-bb6f-13dc05035037",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "26eda02d-2c94-4de6-b5ed-c5edd8a038ee",
      "name": "Plugin: enviar membros",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        2200,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.site_url.replace(/\\/$/, '') }}/wp-json/iwab/v1/groups/{{ $json.id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ members: $json.members, jid: $json.jid }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4fb67548-5765-470a-b798-73488f2a2440",
      "name": "Como ligar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 760,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Como ligar este fluxo\n1. Instale o plugin **Teste A/B WhatsApp** (0.2.0+) no site.\n2. Em **Configuração**, troque `site_url` (seu site), `waha_url` (seu WAHA) e `waha_session` (nome da sessão no WAHA).\n3. Crie a credencial **Header Auth** do plugin: Name `X-IWAB-Key`, Value = a chave do fim da tela do plugin. Selecione nos nós **Plugin: listar grupos** e **Plugin: enviar membros**.\n4. Crie a credencial **Header Auth** do WAHA: Name `X-Api-Key`, Value = a chave da API do WAHA. Selecione nos nós **WAHA: achar grupo pelo convite** e **WAHA: membros do grupo**.\n5. O número da sessão do WAHA precisa estar em **todos os grupos** cadastrados no plugin (convites chat.whatsapp.com). Links do SendFlow não passam por aqui.\n6. Rode com *Execute workflow*, confira no plugin a coluna **Membros** e só então publique/ative.\n\nO fluxo manda só a contagem de membros; a lista de telefones não sai do n8n."
      }
    }
  ],
